# Rule Engine Refactoring Guidelines

## Overview
This rule engine refactoring rule is designed to help improve the performance and maintainability of the rule engine by optimizing its structure and logic.

## Key Principles
- Follow SOLID principles
- Maintain single responsibility
- Optimize for performance
- Ensure extensibility
